# Profile data sync (`src/data/`)

When the user provides **new career information** (facts, dates, role changes, missions, skills, certifications, LinkedIn/CV excerpts, DOCX/PDF dossier, verbal updates), **update the profile JSON in the same session** — do not only acknowledge or plan.

## Source of truth

| File | Update when |
|------|-------------|
| [`src/data/profile.fr.json`](../../src/data/profile.fr.json) | Any professional fact (French copy) |
| [`src/data/profile.en.json`](../../src/data/profile.en.json) | **Same changes in English** — keep structure aligned |

Downstream: site resume ([`locale-data.js`](../../src/js/locale-data.js)), PDF generators ([`scripts/generators/`](../../scripts/generators/)).

## Where to put updates

| User input | `profile.*.json` target |
|------------|---------------------------|
| Name, email, location, links (LinkedIn, GitHub, personal site), years of XP | `identity` |
| Spoken languages | `languagesSpoken` |
| Job / mission (role, company, dates, stack, bullets) | `experience.items[]` — **newest first** |
| ESN-style detail (team, env, tasks) | same item → `dossier.teamAndMethod`, `technicalEnvironment`, `tasks` |
| Education, diploma | `education.items` |
| Skills list / skill map | `skills.items`, `skillCategories` |
| Dossier section labels, savoir-faire, sectors, tech grid | `dossier.*` |

## Also update (only if relevant)

| File | When |
|------|------|
| [`src/translations/fr.json`](../../src/translations/fr.json) / [`en.json`](../../src/translations/en.json) | Pitch changes: `hero`, `about.bio`, `meta`, `services`, `projects` |
| [`scripts/generators/generator-config.json`](../../scripts/generators/generator-config.json) | Target role, ATS keywords, CV/letter summaries — **not** raw experience |

## Rules

1. **Never invent** employers, dates, stacks, or achievements — use only what the user or attached material states.
2. **Always update FR + EN** when the field exists in both files.
3. **Remove or fix stale entries** (old dates, ended roles) when the user indicates a change.
4. **Do not** put long career narrative only in `.cursor/infos/` or chat — persist facts in `profile.*.json`.
5. Reference files in `src/data/` (e.g. sample DOCX/PDF) are **inputs to extract into profile**, not served by the site.

## Checklist before finishing

- [ ] `profile.fr.json` and `profile.en.json` updated and structurally consistent
- [ ] New/updated experience has `dossier` blocks if ESN-level detail was provided
- [ ] `src/translations/` updated only if public pitch/copy should change
- [ ] Mention `npm run generate:cv` / `generate:dossier` if PDFs should be regenerated

